<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>AI-ChatNote — Comment paragraphs, send once</title>
<meta name="description" content="AI-ChatNote is a free browser extension that lets you add inline comments to paragraphs or bullet points in your AI chats, then apply them all at once.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,600;8..60,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --paper: #faf9f5;
    --ink: #1c1b19;
    --ink-soft: #55524c;
    --rule: #ded9cd;
    --mark: #ffd84d;
    --mark-ink: #1c1b19;
    --link: #2f5d55;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  main {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4.5rem 1.5rem 5rem;
  }

  header {
    margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
  }

  .mark {
    display: inline;
    background: linear-gradient(transparent 58%, var(--mark) 58%);
    color: var(--mark-ink);
    padding: 0 0.05em;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 2.9rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
    margin: 0 0 0.55rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .tagline {
    font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 34ch;
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin: 1.6rem 0 0;
  }

  .platforms {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0.85rem 0 0;
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    margin: 1.9rem 0 0;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.15rem;
    border-radius: 7px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    transition: background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--link);
    border-color: var(--link);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
  }

  .btn svg { flex-shrink: 0; }

  section {
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  .media-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
  }

  video, img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  footer {
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.6rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  footer p { margin: 0.35rem 0; }

  footer a { color: var(--link); }

  .privacy {
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    * { transition: none !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>

  <header>
    <h1><span class="mark">AI-ChatNote</span></h1>
    <p class="tagline">Comment on individual paragraphs in AI chat responses before sending your next message.</p>
  </header>

  <p class="lede">
    AI-ChatNote is a free browser extension for Chrome and Firefox that lets you
    add inline comments to individual paragraphs or bullet points, then process
    them all at once for faster, better results. Hover to highlight a passage,
    click to add a comment, and move on — hit Return and every comment is applied
    in a single pass.
  </p>

  <p class="platforms">Works with OpenAI, Anthropic, Google AI and X.</p>

  <div class="actions">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/ai-chatnote/kcpdcndocfoafbdphobjacdnofpmlmac">
      Get it for Chrome
    </a>
    <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://addons.mozilla.org/de/firefox/addon/chatnote/">
      Get it for Firefox
    </a>
  </div>

  <section>
    <p class="media-label">See it in action</p>
    <video src="demo.mp4" controls preload="metadata" playsinline poster="screenshot.png">
      Your browser doesn't support inline video. <a href="demo.mp4">Download the clip</a> instead.
    </video>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p class="media-label">How it looks</p>
    <img src="screenshot.png" alt="AI-ChatNote panel showing paragraph comments in an AI chat interface" loading="lazy">
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p class="privacy">All data stays local to your browser. AI-ChatNote only runs on the supported chat URLs listed in its manifest and never transmits anything to external servers.</p>
    <p>Feedback: <a href="mailto:ChatNote@mail.de">ChatNote@mail.de</a></p>
  </footer>

</main>
</body>
</html>
